## 2. Sliding window / local attention

### Host semantics

```165:174:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_api.cpp
    // Causal is the special case where window_size_right == 0 and window_size_left < 0.
    // Local is the more general case where window_size_right >= 0 or window_size_left >= 0.
    params.is_causal = window_size_left < 0 && window_size_right == 0;
    params.is_local = (window_size_left >= 0 || window_size_right >= 0) && !params.is_causal;
    if (window_size_left < 0 && window_size_right >= 0) { window_size_left = seqlen_k - 1; }
    if (window_size_left >= 0 && window_size_right < 0) { window_size_right = seqlen_q - 1; }
```

Reference mask (non-CP):

```200:207:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/test_util.py
    if window_size[0] < 0:
        return col_idx > row_idx + sk - sq + window_size[1]
    else:
        ...
        return torch.logical_or(
            col_idx > torch.minimum(row_idx + sk - sq + window_size[1], sk),
            torch.logical_and(col_idx < row_idx + sk - sq - window_size[0], col_idx >= sink_token_length),
        )
```

Valid key index `col` for query row `row`:  
`col ≤ min(row + seqlen_k - seqlen_q + W_right, seqlen_k-1)` AND (`col ≥ sink_len` OR `col ≥ row + seqlen_k - seqlen_q - W_left`).

### Block-range skipping (`BlockMN` + vLLM `n_offset`)

**vLLM local-attn patch** — for `Is_local`, shift KV base and shrink effective `seqlen_k`:

```24:33:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/block.h
        if constexpr (Is_local) {
            int m_idx_min = m_block * kBlockM;
            if (PackGQA) { m_idx_min = qhead_per_khead_divmod.divide(m_idx_min); }
            n_offset = std::max(int(0), m_idx_min + seqlen_k - seqlen_q - window_size_left);
            seqlen_k -= n_offset;
        }
```

Upper bound on n_blocks (causal **or** local):

```35:48:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/block.h
        int n_block_max = cute::ceil_div(seqlen_k, kBlockN);
        if constexpr (Is_causal || Is_local) {
            int m_idx_max = (m_block + 1) * kBlockM;
            if (PackGQA) { m_idx_max = qhead_per_khead_divmod.divide(m_idx_max - 1) + 1 ; }
            int tot_seqlen_k = (Is_local) ? seqlen_k : seqlen_info.tot_seqlen_k;
            int n_token_max = m_idx_max + tot_seqlen_k - seqlen_q + window_size_right;
            ...
            n_block_max = std::min(n_block_max, cute::ceil_div(n_token_max, kBlockN));
        }
```

`n_offset` applied to KV pointers:

```700:702:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
        Tensor gK_TMA = local_tile(domain_offset(make_coord(seqlen_info.offset_k + n_offset, _0{}, _0{}), mK_TMA), ...);
        Tensor gVt_TMA = local_tile(domain_offset(make_coord(_0{}, seqlen_info.offset_k + n_offset, _0{}), mVt_TMA), ...);
```

PagedKVNonTMA:

```737:737:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
            bidb_kv, bidh_kv, thread_idx, seqlen_info.seqlen_k - n_offset, seqlen_info.leftpad_k + n_offset, bidb_kv_idx
```

**Three-phase n_block loop** (skip fully-unmasked / fully-masked blocks):

```1283:1322:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
            if constexpr (Is_causal || Is_local) {
                ...
                int const n_block_min_causal_local_mask =
                    std::max(n_block_min, (m_idx_min + seqlen_info.tot_seqlen_k - seqlen_q + params.window_size_right) / kBlockN);
                for (; n_block >= n_block_min_causal_local_mask; --n_block) {
                    fwd_step(n_block, mask_fn, ...);
                }
            }
            int const n_block_min_before_local_mask = !Is_local ? n_block_min
                : std::max(n_block_min, cute::ceil_div(m_idx_max + seqlen_info.tot_seqlen_k - seqlen_q - params.window_size_left, kBlockN));
            for (; n_block >= n_block_min_before_local_mask; --n_block) {
                fwd_step(n_block, no_mask_fn, ...);  // no per-element mask
            }
            if constexpr (Is_local) {
                for (; n_block >= n_block_min; --n_block) {
                    fwd_step(n_block, local_mask_fn, ...);  // local mask only, Causal_mask=false
                }
            }
```

Phase 1: right-edge (causal + local) masking. Phase 2: **no mask** (all keys in window). Phase 3: left-edge local masking only.

Early exit when no valid blocks:

```1018:1020:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
        if constexpr (Is_causal || Is_local || Varlen || Split) {
            if (n_block_max <= n_block_min) { return false; }
        }
```

### Per-element local mask (`mask.h`)

Local branch (`Causal_mask=false, Local_mask=true`):

```117:134:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mask.h
                } else {
                    int const local_row_offset_right = causal_row_offset + window_size_right;
                    int const local_row_offset_left = causal_row_offset - 1 - window_size_left;
                    int const col_limit_sink = sink_token_length - n_block * kBlockN;
                    ...
                            if (col_idx >= col_limit_right || (col_idx < col_limit_left && col_idx >= col_limit_sink)) { tSrS_rowcol(m, n) = -INFINITY; }
```

Positional **sink tokens** (first `sink_token_length` keys always visible even left of window) use `col_limit_sink`. In forward mainloop this is currently forced:

```1100:1103:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
        // NOTE: sink_token_length is dead code
        flash::Mask<...> mask(
            ..., 0 - n_offset /*sink_token_length*/,
```

So **learned sinks (`s_aux`) are separate** from positional `sink_token_length` in the shipped forward path.

