## 3. Attention sinks (`s_aux`)

### What it is

`Flash_fwd_params.s_aux_ptr` — per **query head** scalar (bf16), shape `(num_heads)`:

```169:170:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash.h
    // The S extra matrix, (num_heads)
    void *__restrict__ s_aux_ptr;
```

Host validation:

```1211:1221:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_api.cpp
    if(s_aux_.has_value()) {
        ...
        TORCH_CHECK(s_aux.scalar_type() == at::ScalarType::BFloat16, ...);
        CHECK_SHAPE(s_aux, num_heads);
        params.s_aux_ptr = s_aux.data_ptr();
```

Reference semantics — extra softmax column, **excluded from V matmul**:

```409:416:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/test_util.py
    if s_aux is not None:
        s_aux = s_aux.reshape(1, nheads, 1, 1).expand(batch_size, -1, seqlen_q, -1)
        scores = torch.cat([scores, s_aux], dim=-1)
    attention = torch.softmax(scores, dim=-1).to(v.dtype)
    if s_aux is not None:
        attention = attention[..., :-1]
```

### Device path

Load to smem once per kernel (`flash_fwd_kernel_sm90.h:306-308`):

```306:308:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/flash_fwd_kernel_sm90.h
        if(params.mainloop.ptr_S_aux && threadIdx.x < num_heads) {
            sS_aux(threadIdx.x) = gS_aux(threadIdx.x);
        }
```

After all K blocks, **`finalize_aux`** adds sink mass to denominator (not to O):

```1137:1164:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/mainloop_fwd_sm90_tma_gmma_ws.hpp
        auto finalize_dispatch = [&](TensorT& scores_scale, float const v_descale) {
            if (params.ptr_S_aux && (!Split || (split_idx & 0x0000FFFF) == 0)) {
                ...
                        tSrS_aux(mi) = static_cast<float>(sS_aux(bidh));  // or PackGQA head mapping
                cute::copy(softmax.finalize_aux(tSrS_aux, v_descale), scores_scale);
            } else {
                cute::copy(softmax.finalize(v_descale), scores_scale);
            }
        };
```

Core math:

```156:174:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/softmax.h
    __forceinline__ __device__ TensorT finalize_aux(TensorT const& tSrSAux, float const final_scale=1.f) {
        ...
            const float max_scaled = row_max(mi) * softmax_scale_log2 - Max_offset;
            float sum = row_sum(mi) + exp2f(float(M_LOG2E) * tSrSAux(mi) - max_scaled);
            ...
            scores_scale(mi) = inv_sum * final_scale;
            row_sum(mi) = ... row_max(mi) * (softmax_scale_log2 * float(M_LN2)) + __logf(sum);
```

Equivalent to: `sum_total = Σ_keys exp(cap*tanh_k - max*cap) + exp(s_aux - max*cap)` when softcap is on (same `max_scaled`). LSE uses the augmented sum. Output normalization uses `1/sum_total`; sink does not add to `tOrO`.

Split-KV: only split index 0 includes sink (`split_idx & 0xFFFF == 0`).

